{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1366.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b4139d4b90bf1db4b92ae94da4657af5ab9dd726dd475d125fabe9e8ef3f641a","ja":"真くんのとっておきの方法……！\nぜひ、ぜひ教えてくださいっ！！","zh":"真同学的独门绝招……！\n请务必、务必教教我！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1366.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"6022e484f73aa3256f083e0bf894b2cdbf4807363f9f93178e39419603a0e62e","ja":"私もちょっと気になるわ。\nいったい何をするの？","zh":"我也稍微有点好奇呢。\n到底要做什么呀？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1366.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"26097dee9a5e5ccb82399527f8e6c1bda7bd11788b3d682eef9ee2e31e4933c6","ja":"それはね……王子様を意識させないように、\nいつもフリフリのかわいい服を着るようにするんだ！","zh":"那就是呢……为了不让人联想到王子殿下，\n特意总是穿那些可爱的荷叶边衣服！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1366.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"5fcc4e5d3ecf2722661a54732253533ed8a1baa2285e567057edde5916dbd546","ja":"えっ、フリフリのかわいい服、ですか～！？","zh":"哎，荷叶边的可爱服装，是吗～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1366.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"2756b7577ea3e18a564a5a0e1d014b2b037d75a0fc506869d73491245af3c95a","ja":"さ、さすがに、いつもそういう服を着るのは……。\nそっちも恥ずかしいというか……。","zh":"再、再怎么说，一直穿那种衣服也……\n那边也挺让人不好意思的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1366.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"87b4a7bcd194d7bee6293e5f40543f026747fef4626f2be566dd58b0a6ca6b8b","ja":"じゃあ、ボクも一緒に着るよ！\nそれなら恥ずかしくないでしょ♪","zh":"那我来陪你一起穿吧！\n这样的话就不会觉得难为情了吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1366.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"2d89f0e50e85ed31271acbd5d2cd0e63e71011faaa19c8099fe1e0df886d39c3","ja":"ええっ！？\nま、真くんもですか！？","zh":"诶！？\n真、真你也去吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1366.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"b4d6ede69a06295f7303d1f5442bb058d829100b9208eb10597b16138ab3fb98","ja":"レアなお姿が見れるのは\nとっても嬉しいですけど……。","zh":"能见到您罕见的模样，\n我确实非常高兴，不过……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1366.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"7d6468b82e27db095392ac7ef86bd8915b38f26476c40d78cce5f73bd493b09f","ja":"どんな方法かと思ったら……\n単に真が、かわいい服を着たいだけじゃないの？","zh":"还以为是什么办法呢……\n不就是真单纯地想穿可爱的衣服吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1366.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"e248a16ed1fd18d25349931380b77ced42763f49fda62039aa84d21bd6b68a63","ja":"そ、そんなことないよ！　見た目が女の子～！って\n感じなら、王子様をお願いしにくくなるかなって……。","zh":"没、没有那回事啦！我只是在想，要是外表显得\n很～女孩子气，可能就不太好拜托你演王子了吧……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1366.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"8ea608db1f25b1f19263d7988eadeced32ca4285b471537ac923cf62b0d0345f","ja":"まあ、ピンクでフリルがついてる服を着てる真に、\n「王子様をやって」とは言わないわね。","zh":"也是呢，总不会对着穿着带荷叶边的\n粉色衣服的真说“来演王子殿下吧”。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1366.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"e7f382d625eca54746a39af955c8728b9a7ee9d40d06a85c7f857ffe32577a65","ja":"はっ！？　でもそうすると、いつもの真くんが\n見られなくなってしまう、ってことですよね……！？","zh":"啊！？但要是那样的话，岂不是就\n见不到平时的真了吗……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1366.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"31e223ddabccecbf8ad721d998b230dda2b6d7b2ce303432ee3942b3f877a2e6","ja":"ボクのことは気にしないで！　\n1ヶ月くらい、ガツンとかわいい服を着て過ごそうよ♪","zh":"不用在意我啦！\n这1个月左右，就痛痛快快穿上可爱的衣服过吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1366.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"086d8aacc37a82359a49615d8b569ec4089bb01f259e6f4934d599a7041e80d5","ja":"そうですね……。","zh":"对啊……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1366.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"ae047dc12f3da23f923e223ef8316e01504c153e5a34cb6f5fe893b5a1e50d37","ja":"真くん、伊織ちゃん……ありさ、決めました！\nありさは……。","zh":"真、伊织……亚利沙决定了！\n亚利沙要……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
